# Reuse-first Mastermind engineering

Before implementing substantial solved machinery (charting, UI, agent harnesses, monitoring, scheduling or common infrastructure), inspect the incumbent owner and suitable maintained OSS. Prefer a narrow adapter, composition or extension; reserve custom engineering for genuinely differentiated or incompatible cases, especially independently validated sector/quant strategies.

Check maintenance, existing security boundaries, dependencies, integration fit and real consumer tests when material. Avoid copying proprietary competitor code or building a second Executive, Agent OS, Fabric, lifecycle, auth, queue or retry plane. Keep research proportionate: no approval form, exhaustive survey or delay for trivial repairs.

Follow the protected `docs/REUSE_FIRST_ENGINEERING.md` rule at a compatible source pin. This rule grants no write, merge, install, credential, runtime or trading authority.
